-- Valdo's Puzzle Box outcomes: the foil Valdo Maps poewiki's "List of Valdo's Puzzle Box foil maps" records
-- (compiled from trade data, read 2026-11-27). area_id is the layout's MapWorlds WorldAreas row (NULL: a random Atlas
-- layout); foil is RelicItemEffectVariations' row; weight is the reward's unique_weights rarity at the time, since
-- 3.29 weights a box outcome by the reward's rarity (the per-modifier factors are not published).

-- The Valdo Map modifier pool: Mods' MapSupporter rows (Domain 5, GenerationType 3), which carry no spawn weights;
-- the equal weights are ours. The Void modifier is rolled apart (valdo_void_map_chance_pct).

-- G: how many Valdo modifiers a box's map rolls, and how often it is a Void map (no published 3.29 numbers).
